---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const repo = 'https://github.com/nanbo0ne/O.R.C.A-for-Windows';

const goVer = '3.0.9';
---
<Base
  title="Docs — O.R.C.A"
  titleEn="Docs — O.R.C.A"
  titleZh="文档 — O.R.C.A"
  description="O.R.C.A 3.0.9: standard Windows installation, native Go process checks, draft/session-saving shutdown, setup, DeepSeek V4.1 Flash vision, workspaces, tools, and permissions. Modern / Classic remain. Managed local AI and Computer Use remain disabled.">

  <header class="nav scrolled">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a class="brand" href={`${base}/`}><img src={`${base}/logo.svg`} alt="O.R.C.A logo" /><span>O.R.C.A</span></a>
      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href={`${base}/#features`}><span class="l-en">Features</span><span class="l-zh">特性</span></a>
        <a href={`${base}/#how`}><span class="l-en">How it works</span><span class="l-zh">工作原理</span></a>
        <a href={`${base}/#community`}><span class="l-en">Community</span><span class="l-zh">社区</span></a>
        <a href={`${base}/docs/`} class="here"><span class="l-en">Docs</span><span class="l-zh">文档</span></a>
        <a href={`${base}/#start`}><span class="l-en">Get started</span><span class="l-zh">快速开始</span></a>
      </nav>
      <div class="lang-switch" role="group" aria-label="Language">
        <button type="button" data-lang="en" class="active">EN</button>
        <button type="button" data-lang="zh">中文</button>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-dark" href={`${base}/#start`}><span class="l-en">Install</span><span class="l-zh">安装</span></a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="docs-layout">
    <aside class="docs-side">
      <div class="side-group">
        <span class="gh"><span class="l-en">Getting started</span><span class="l-zh">快速开始</span></span>
        <a href="#install"><span class="l-en">Installation</span><span class="l-zh">安装</span></a>
        <a href="#quickstart"><span class="l-en">Quick start</span><span class="l-zh">快速上手</span></a>
        <a href="#config"><span class="l-en">Configuration</span><span class="l-zh">配置</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="side-group">
        <span class="gh"><span class="l-en">Concepts</span><span class="l-zh">核心概念</span></span>
        <a href="#cache"><span class="l-en">Prefix cache</span><span class="l-zh">前缀缓存</span></a>
        <a href="#permissions"><span class="l-en">Permissions &amp; sandbox</span><span class="l-zh">权限与沙箱</span></a>
        <a href="#mcp"><span class="l-en">Plugins (MCP)</span><span class="l-zh">插件(MCP)</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="side-group">
        <span class="gh"><span class="l-en">Reference</span><span class="l-zh">参考</span></span>
        <a href="#cli"><span class="l-en">CLI &amp; slash commands</span><span class="l-zh">命令行与斜杠命令</span></a>
        <a href="#configfile"><span class="l-en">Config file</span><span class="l-zh">配置文件</span></a>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <article class="docs-main">
      <h1><span class="l-en">Documentation</span><span class="l-zh">文档</span></h1>
      <h2><span class="l-en">3.0.9 version overview</span><span class="l-zh">3.0.9 版本概览</span></h2>
      <p><span class="l-en">O.R.C.A combines Assistant, Coding, ORCA Agent, providers, projects, sessions, attachments, artifacts, tools, memory, and automation. 3.0.9 restores the standard Windows NSIS / MUI2 wizard and uses native Go process detection. With no target process and replaceable files, installation continues immediately; graceful exit gets up to 5 seconds before only confirmed target remnants are terminated. The new shutdown channel saves drafts, attachments, and sessions, with distinct file-lock, permission, and detection errors. Modern / Classic are unchanged. See the <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/releases/desktop-v3.0.9.md`}>bilingual release notes</a>, <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/build/desktop-v3.0.9.md`}>build checklist</a>, and <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/audits/desktop-v3.0.9-verification.md`}>release verification record</a>. Managed local AI and Computer Use remain disabled on every platform, with code, configuration, and model files retained.</span><span class="l-zh">O.R.C.A 集成助手、编程、ORCA Agent、供应商、项目、会话、附件、产物、工具、记忆和自动化。3.0.9 恢复标准 Windows NSIS / MUI2 向导，采用原生 Go 进程检测。无目标进程且文件可替换时立即继续；正常退出最多等待 5 秒后，仅结束已确认的目标残留。新版退出通道保存草稿、附件与会话，并区分文件占用、权限及检测失败。Modern / Classic 不变。详见<a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/releases/desktop-v3.0.9.md`}>双语发布说明</a>、<a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/build/desktop-v3.0.9.md`}>构建清单</a>与<a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/audits/desktop-v3.0.9-verification.md`}>发布验收记录</a>。托管本地 AI 与电脑操控在所有平台继续禁用，代码、配置和模型文件保留。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">Provider protocol selection, Agent endpoint normalization, and tool-summary corrections from 3.0.6/3.0.7 remain. Skipped installation files remain prohibited. Forced termination of an unresponsive older version cannot guarantee preservation of unsaved content; save tasks before manual upgrades.</span><span class="l-zh">3.0.6/3.0.7 已有的供应商协议选择、Agent 端点规范化及工具摘要修复继续保留；继续禁止跳过安装文件。强制结束无响应旧版本不能保证保存尚未落盘的内容，手动升级前请保存任务。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">Official <code>deepseek/deepseek-flash</code> identifies DeepSeek V4.1 Flash: native vision, 1M context, up to 384K output tokens, tools, and JSON Output. The output maximum is not the default request budget. <code>deepseek-v4-flash</code> and <code>deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp</code> are aliases, routed to V4.1 Flash at Flash rates. <code>deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro</code> remains available and text-only.</span><span class="l-zh">官方 <code>deepseek/deepseek-flash</code> 对应 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash，支持原生视觉、1M 上下文、最大 384K 输出、工具与 JSON Output；输出上限不是默认请求预算。<code>deepseek-v4-flash</code> 与 <code>deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp</code> 是兼容别名，路由至 V4.1 Flash 并按 Flash 计费。<code>deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro</code> 仍可选择，保持文本模型。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">The one-time official Flash migration was introduced in 3.0.5 for older defaults, roles, and saved sessions, including old Pro choices. 3.0.9 does not repeat completed migration. Custom providers, proxy endpoints, separate credentials, historical messages, and deliberate Pro choices made afterward are preserved. Effort remains <code>low/high/max</code>; <code>auto = high</code>. Thinking mode and effort are separate.</span><span class="l-zh">官方 Flash 一次性迁移已在 3.0.5 引入，面向更早版本的默认值、角色与保存会话，包括旧 Pro 选择；3.0.9 不重复已完成的迁移。自定义供应商、代理端点、独立凭据、历史消息及迁移后主动选择的 Pro 保留。思考强度仍为 <code>low/high/max</code>，<code>auto = high</code>；思考开关与强度独立。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">Retained from 3.0.8: the Modern turn rail centers vertically around its contents and grows to 240px before scrolling. The Composer and queue/approval areas center at up to 884px, while the transcript viewport fills the pane. Running status has its own middle track; effort, model, pause/resume, and send/stop stay on the right in that order. Effort remains visible and shows Model default when capabilities are unknown, with an entry to provider settings. Model/effort menus support arrow keys, Home/End, and focus restoration. Narrow approval height and restored-history jump offsets are corrected.</span><span class="l-zh">保留 3.0.8 改进：Modern 回合导航按内容垂直居中，增长至 240px 后内部滚动；输入区与队列/审批区居中且最大宽度为 884px，聊天滚动视口仍占满面板。运行状态独占中间区域，右侧依次为思考强度、模型、暂停/恢复和发送/停止。强度入口始终可见，未知能力显示“模型默认”并提供供应商设置入口。模型/强度菜单支持方向键、Home/End 和焦点恢复，同时修正窄窗口审批区高度和旧历史跳转偏移。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">Compact/Detailed still controls provider reasoning only; final answers stay outside completed summaries showing elapsed time, tokens, and known official DeepSeek cost. Existing summary merging retains actual stage text and order. Todo remains above the Composer without a full-width backdrop, and the fixed sidebar entry is ORCA Agent.</span><span class="l-zh">简略/详细仍仅控制供应商 reasoning；最终答案保持独立，完成摘要显示耗时、token 及可确认的 DeepSeek 官方费用。已有摘要合并保留真实阶段文本及顺序。Todo 仍浮于输入框上方且无全宽底色，固定侧栏入口为 ORCA Agent。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">The <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/audits/2026-09-18-modern-chat-polish.md`}>UI audit</a> records 362 cases and 3990 assertions with no failures, including 60 Classic CSS comparisons with no geometry or computed-style differences; attachment smoke checks add 24 separate assertions. Browser backends are mocked. This does not establish real-provider, installation, or three-platform release acceptance.</span><span class="l-zh"><a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/audits/2026-09-18-modern-chat-polish.md`}>界面审计</a>记录 362 场景、3990 断言零失败，含 Classic 60 组 CSS 几何和计算样式零差异对照；附件另有 24 条烟测断言。浏览器使用模拟后端，这不构成真实供应商、安装升级或三平台发布验收。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">Generated images require read/send permissions and a validated snapshot before visual delegation. Downloads show source, speed, and ETA; cancel before switching to another source for the same signed file. Speed depends on the actual route. New builds omit old-brand duplicates; existing releases are retained. Full product documentation: <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/README.en.md`}>English README</a>.</span><span class="l-zh">生成图片经读取/发送权限与快照校验后才能委派识图。下载显示来源、速度与 ETA；先取消，再切换同一签名文件的来源。实际速度取决于网络。新版本不生成旧品牌副本，历史发布保留。完整产品介绍见<a href={`${repo}/blob/main/README.md`}>中文 README</a>。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">DeepSeek official pricing checked on 2026-09-17: CNY per million tokens; Flash aliases use the same rates. Peak time is fixed UTC+8 Monday-Friday 09:00-12:00 and 14:00-18:00; all other times, including weekends, are off-peak. Each request freezes pricing at start. Stored historical amounts retain their currencies without recalculation, and mixed USD/CNY sessions do not display one authoritative combined total. Sources: <a href="https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start/pricing/">pricing</a>, <a href="https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/updates">updates</a>, <a href="https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/guides/thinking_mode/">thinking mode</a>.</span><span class="l-zh">2026-09-17 核对 DeepSeek 官方价格，单位 CNY/百万 token，Flash 别名同价。峰时固定为 UTC+8 周一至周五 09:00-12:00、14:00-18:00，其余含周末为闲时。每次请求开始时冻结价格；历史金额不重算、不改币种，USD/CNY 混合会话不合并为一个权威总额。来源：<a href="https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/quick_start/pricing/">价格页</a>、<a href="https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/updates">更新日志</a>、<a href="https://api-docs.deepseek.com/zh-cn/guides/thinking_mode/">思考模式</a>。</span></p>
      <table>
        <thead><tr><th><span class="l-en">Model and period</span><span class="l-zh">模型与时段</span></th><th><span class="l-en">Cache-hit input</span><span class="l-zh">缓存命中输入</span></th><th><span class="l-en">Cache-miss input</span><span class="l-zh">未命中输入</span></th><th><span class="l-en">Output</span><span class="l-zh">输出</span></th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>V4.1 Flash <span class="l-en">off-peak</span><span class="l-zh">闲时</span></td><td>¥0.02</td><td>¥1</td><td>¥4</td></tr>
          <tr><td>V4.1 Flash <span class="l-en">peak</span><span class="l-zh">峰时</span></td><td>¥0.04</td><td>¥2</td><td>¥8</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Pro <span class="l-en">off-peak</span><span class="l-zh">闲时</span></td><td>¥0.15</td><td>¥4.5</td><td>¥13.5</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Pro <span class="l-en">peak</span><span class="l-zh">峰时</span></td><td>¥0.30</td><td>¥9</td><td>¥27</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <h2><span class="l-en">Setup and reference</span><span class="l-zh">安装与使用参考</span></h2>
      <p class="lede"><span class="l-en">Install O.R.C.A, configure a provider, and start a session. CLI and desktop use separate release channels. Full product coverage is in the <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/README.en.md`}>English README</a>.</span><span class="l-zh">安装 O.R.C.A、配置供应商并开始会话。CLI 与桌面端独立发布；完整产品说明见<a href={`${repo}/blob/main/README.md`}>中文 README</a>。</span></p>

      <p><span class="l-en">Computer Use remains disabled on Windows, macOS, and Linux in 3.0.9: no computer-control tools, screen capture, or native input. Consent, Full access, bots, and automation cannot enable it. Authorized image attachments remain supported. The <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/audits/desktop-v3.0.5-verification.md`}>3.0.5 audit</a> and <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/audits/2026-09-08-v3.0.4-release-validation.md`}>3.0.4 audit</a> are historical evidence, not acceptance for 3.0.9.</span><span class="l-zh">3.0.9 在 Windows、macOS、Linux 继续禁用电脑操控，不注册电脑工具、不截屏、不执行原生输入；已有授权、Full access、机器人和自动化不能开启它。获准发送的图片附件仍可使用。<a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/audits/desktop-v3.0.5-verification.md`}>3.0.5 审计</a>与<a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/audits/2026-09-08-v3.0.4-release-validation.md`}>3.0.4 审计</a>仅为历史记录，不代表 3.0.9 验收。</span></p>

      <h2 id="install"><span class="l-en">Installation</span><span class="l-zh">安装</span></h2>
      <p><span class="l-en">One command on macOS, Linux, Windows, or WSL.</span><span class="l-zh">一条命令,支持 macOS、Linux、Windows 或 WSL。</span></p>
      <div class="codeblock"><button data-copy="npm i -g orca-agent">Copy</button><span class="c"># npm (recommended · 推荐)</span>
npm i -g orca-agent

<span class="c"># Homebrew</span>
brew install nanbo0ne/O.R.C.A-for-Windows/orca-agent</div>
      <div class="callout"><span class="ico">!</span><span><span class="l-en">Download v{goVer} packages and checksums from the <a href={`${repo}/releases/tag/desktop-v${goVer}`}>Release page</a>. Back up configuration and sessions before upgrading.</span><span class="l-zh">v{goVer} 安装包和校验表见 <a href={`${repo}/releases/tag/desktop-v${goVer}`}>Release 页</a>。升级前备份配置与会话。</span></span></div>
      <p><span class="l-en">Prefer a GUI? Desktop apps for macOS, Windows, and Linux are on the <a href={`${base}/#start`}>download page</a>.</span><span class="l-zh">想用图形界面?macOS、Windows、Linux 桌面端请前往<a href={`${base}/#start`}>下载页</a>。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">The desktop matrix remains Windows x64 installer/portable ZIP, macOS 12+ Universal DMG, and Linux x64 DEB with matching GTK/WebKitGTK. Windows packages lack Authenticode publisher signing; macOS packages are not notarized. Minisign verifies update integrity, not operating-system publisher trust.</span><span class="l-zh">桌面包矩阵延续 Windows x64 安装器/便携 ZIP、macOS 12+ Universal DMG、Linux x64 DEB（需匹配 GTK/WebKitGTK）。Windows 包未作 Authenticode 发布者签名，macOS 包未公证；Minisign 验证更新完整性，不等于操作系统发布者认证。</span></p>

      <h2 id="quickstart"><span class="l-en">Quick start</span><span class="l-zh">快速上手</span></h2>
      <p><span class="l-en">Desktop first run offers DeepSeek key validation or skip. Custom providers and external compatible local services can be configured separately; managed local model installation is disabled. For CLI sessions, configure your provider with <code>orca setup</code>, then open a repository:</span><span class="l-zh">桌面端首次运行可验证 DeepSeek Key 或跳过；自定义供应商与外部兼容本地服务可另行配置，托管本地模型安装保持禁用。使用 CLI 时先通过 <code>orca setup</code> 配置供应商，再进入仓库：</span></p>
      <div class="codeblock"><button data-copy="cd your-project && orca code">Copy</button>cd your-project
orca code</div>
      <p><span class="l-en">Then just describe the task:</span><span class="l-zh">然后直接描述任务:</span></p>
      <div class="codeblock"><span class="a">›</span> add retry with backoff to the http client
<span class="a">›</span> refactor the auth flow, keep the public API stable
<span class="a">›</span> why is the worker leaking memory?</div>
      <p><span class="l-en">In the desktop app, you can also attach an image you choose and ask, "Extract the table as CSV," or attach a document for a summary. These tasks use ordinary attachments and do not start Computer Use.</span><span class="l-zh">桌面端也可手动附上图片并提问“提取表格并整理成 CSV”，或附上文档要求摘要。这些任务使用普通附件，不会启动电脑操控。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">Stable request prefixes can help reuse provider caches. Cache availability and hit rates depend on the provider and request contents; neither every-turn hits nor lower response latency are guaranteed.</span><span class="l-zh">稳定请求前缀有助于复用供应商缓存。缓存是否可用及命中率取决于供应商与请求内容，不保证每轮命中或降低响应延迟。</span></p>

      <h2 id="config"><span class="l-en">Configuration</span><span class="l-zh">配置</span></h2>
      <p><span class="l-en">O.R.C.A connects to the provider you choose with your own API key. Secrets come from the environment via <code>api_key_env</code> and are never written to config files:</span><span class="l-zh">O.R.C.A 使用你自己的 API Key 连接所选供应商。密钥通过 <code>api_key_env</code> 从环境读取,绝不写入配置文件:</span></p>
      <div class="codeblock"><button data-copy="export DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-...">Copy</button>export DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-...</div>
      <p><span class="l-en">Model requests go to your configured provider. Enabled tools, MCP servers, and bot integrations can send data to additional endpoints under their permissions. Persistent options live in the <a href="#configfile">config file</a>.</span><span class="l-zh">模型请求发送至所配置的供应商；启用的工具、MCP 与机器人集成也可能在权限范围内向其他端点发送数据。持久化选项见<a href="#configfile">配置文件</a>。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">Vision uses an explicit role first, then a confirmed vision-capable current model, then official <code>deepseek/deepseek-flash</code>. Image read/send permissions and an explicit vision-off setting remain effective. New unconfigured subagents inherit the main model; 3.0.9 preserves choices made after the earlier official migration. Saved Computer Use roles remain inactive, and no API key is bundled.</span><span class="l-zh">视觉先使用明确角色，再取已确认支持图片的当前模型，最后使用官方 <code>deepseek/deepseek-flash</code>。图片读取/发送权限及显式关闭视觉仍有效。新建未配置子代理继承主模型；3.0.9 保留此前官方迁移后主动设置的选择。保留的 Computer Use 角色不运行，包内不含 API key。</span></p>

      <h2 id="cache"><span class="l-en">Prefix cache</span><span class="l-zh">前缀缓存</span></h2>
      <p><span class="l-en">DeepSeek charges cache-hit and cache-miss input tokens at the separate prices above. Input cost also depends on token counts, output use, and the request time band. Rewriting context can reduce prefix reuse.</span><span class="l-zh">DeepSeek 对命中与未命中输入 token 分别使用上表价格；实际总费用还取决于 token 数、输出用量及请求时段。改写上下文可能减少前缀复用。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">O.R.C.A keeps stable prefixes where possible; compaction and configuration changes can alter them. No fixed cache-hit percentage, cost reduction, or generation speed is promised. Use actual provider usage and billing records to assess results.</span><span class="l-zh">O.R.C.A 尽量保持稳定前缀，压缩和配置变化可能改变前缀。不承诺固定命中率、费用降幅或生成速度，应以实际供应商用量和计费记录评估结果。</span></p>

      <h2 id="permissions"><span class="l-en">Permissions &amp; sandbox</span><span class="l-zh">权限与沙箱</span></h2>
          <p><span class="l-en">Permissions gate each tool call: <code>deny</code> &gt; <code>ask</code> &gt; <code>allow</code> &gt; fallback. Readers always allow; writers fall back to <code>[permissions] mode</code>. <code>orca chat</code> prompts before each writer; <code>orca run</code> stays autonomous but still honours <code>deny</code>.</span><span class="l-zh">权限逐个把关工具调用:<code>deny</code> &gt; <code>ask</code> &gt; <code>allow</code> &gt; 兜底。读工具始终放行;写工具回退到 <code>[permissions] mode</code>。<code>orca chat</code> 在每次写操作前询问;<code>orca run</code> 自主运行,但仍遵守 <code>deny</code>。</span></p>
      <p><span class="l-en">The sandbox is enforcement: file-writers refuse any path outside <code>[sandbox] workspace_root</code> (default: the current dir), resolving symlinks and <code>..</code> so a link can't tunnel out. Reads are unrestricted.</span><span class="l-zh">沙箱负责强制执行:写文件工具拒绝 <code>[sandbox] workspace_root</code>(默认当前目录)之外的任何路径,并解析符号链接与 <code>..</code>,防止借链接逃逸。读取不受限。</span></p>

      <h2 id="mcp"><span class="l-en">Plugins (MCP)</span><span class="l-zh">插件(MCP)</span></h2>
      <p><span class="l-en">O.R.C.A is an MCP client. A <code>[[plugins]]</code> entry's <code>type</code> selects the transport — <code>stdio</code> (default) launches a local subprocess, <code>http</code> connects to a remote <code>url</code>. Tools surface to the model as <code>mcp__&lt;server&gt;__&lt;tool&gt;</code>. Already have an <code>.mcp.json</code>? Drop it in the project root and O.R.C.A reads it as-is.</span><span class="l-zh">O.R.C.A 是一个 MCP 客户端。<code>[[plugins]]</code> 条目的 <code>type</code> 选择传输方式——<code>stdio</code>(默认)启动本地子进程,<code>http</code> 连接远程 <code>url</code>。工具以 <code>mcp__&lt;server&gt;__&lt;tool&gt;</code> 呈现给模型。已有 <code>.mcp.json</code>?放到项目根目录,O.R.C.A 会原样读取。</span></p>
      <div class="codeblock"><span class="c"># orca.toml</span>
[[plugins]]                       <span class="c"># local stdio server</span>
name    = "example"
command = "orca-plugin-example"

[[plugins]]                       <span class="c"># remote server over Streamable HTTP</span>
name    = "stripe"
type    = "http"
url     = "https://mcp.stripe.com"
headers = &#123; Authorization = "Bearer $&#123;STRIPE_KEY&#125;" &#125;</div>

      <h2 id="cli"><span class="l-en">CLI &amp; slash commands</span><span class="l-zh">命令行与斜杠命令</span></h2>
      <div class="codeblock">orca setup            <span class="c"># configure a provider or skip setup</span>
orca code             <span class="c"># start an interactive session in the current repo</span>
orca chat             <span class="c"># interactive session, prompts before writes</span>
orca run "&lt;task&gt;"     <span class="c"># autonomous run, honours deny rules</span></div>
      <p><span class="l-en">Inside a session, slash commands run locally — <code>/help</code> lists them all:</span><span class="l-zh">会话中,斜杠命令在本地运行——<code>/help</code> 列出全部:</span></p>
      <div class="codeblock">/compact   /new      /rewind   /tree     /branch
/switch    /todo     /model    /mcp      /skills
/hooks     /memory   /language /output-style       /help</div>
      <p><span class="l-en"><code>/branch [name]</code> forks the current conversation tip, <code>/switch &lt;id|name&gt;</code> loads another branch. Custom commands are Markdown files under <code>.orca/commands/</code>.</span><span class="l-zh"><code>/branch [name]</code> 从当前会话尖端分叉,<code>/switch &lt;id|name&gt;</code> 加载另一条分支。自定义命令是 <code>.orca/commands/</code> 下的 Markdown 文件。</span></p>

      <h2 id="configfile"><span class="l-en">Config file</span><span class="l-zh">配置文件</span></h2>
      <p><span class="l-en">Resolution order: flag &gt; <code>./orca.toml</code> &gt; <code>~/.config/orca/config.toml</code> &gt; built-in defaults.</span><span class="l-zh">解析顺序:flag &gt; <code>./orca.toml</code> &gt; <code>~/.config/orca/config.toml</code> &gt; 内置默认值。</span></p>
      <div class="codeblock"><span class="c"># ~/.config/orca/config.toml</span>
default_model = "deepseek/deepseek-flash"

[agent]
auto_plan = "ask"                  <span class="c"># off|ask|on</span>

[[providers]]
name        = "deepseek"
kind        = "openai"
base_url    = "https://api.deepseek.com"
model       = "deepseek-flash"
api_key_env = "DEEPSEEK_API_KEY"

[permissions]
mode  = "ask"                                <span class="c"># ask|allow|deny</span>
deny  = ["bash(rm -rf*)", "bash(git push*)"]
allow = ["bash(go test*)"]</div>
      <p><span class="l-en">For the full schema and every field's contract, see <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/SPEC.md`}>SPEC.md §5</a>.</span><span class="l-zh">完整 schema 与每个字段的契约见 <a href={`${repo}/blob/main/docs/SPEC.md`}>SPEC.md §5</a>。</span></p>

